d cryptocurrency support center. Find our FAQs on topics such as deposits and withdrawals, trading, account verification, account security, etc.\",\"L0003939\":\"Failed\",\"L0008621\":\"Click to retry\",\"L0019394\":\"When not logged in, up to 30 favorites can be added for each trading type\",\"L0002175\":\"Added\",\"L0004249\":\"Please log in first\",\"L0012361\":\"Failed to add to favorites\",\"L0002176\":\"Deleted\",\"L0000381\":\"Saved\",\"L0008309\":\"Perp\",\"L0015889\":\"Delisting\",\"L0015890\":\"Delisting\",\"L0017031\":\"LBank plans to delist {1} perpetual contracts at {0} (UTC). Please close any open positions of this contract before delisting to avoid unnecessary losses.\",\"L0001095\":\"Risk Warning\",\"L0016990\":\"The current contract is marked with an \\\"Inno\\\" label, indicating high trading risk. This label suggests significant market volatility, insufficient liquidity, or potential compliance risks. We strongly recommend fully understanding the related risks and carefully assessing your risk tolerance before trading.\",\"L0023396\":\"Market closed\",\"L0021938\":\"Stocks\",\"L0000183\":\"All\",\"L6671006\":\"Selected for You\",\"L6671007\":\"Daily picks of top AI trading bots to help you profit from market volatility!\",\"L0000831\":\"Close\",\"L0001568\":\"Grid\",\"L6668791\":\"Auto-Invest\",\"L0002795\":\"Long\",\"L0002794\":\"Short\",\"L0016001\":\"Neutral\",\"L6668793\":\"{0} users have used\",\"L0024284\":\"14D APR\",\"L0001645\":\"APY\",\"L0017044\":\"Create now\",\"L0010406\":\"Add to Favorites\",\"L0015840\":\"Go to markets\",\"L0013864\":\"Total Assets\",\"L6007879\":\"Total Assets = Spot Account Current Value{0} + Earn Account Current Value{1}{2}\",\"L0014188\":\"Latest Value of Futures Account\",\"L0022838\":\"Copy Trading Account Latest Value\",\"L0021482\":\"Grid Account Latest Value\",\"L0014190\":\"Latest Value of Spending Account\",\"L0002500\":\"Spot\",\"L0013866\":\"Spot Asset Valuation = Token Equity x Latest Price\",\"L0001127\":\"Futures\",\"L0013867\":\"Futures Margin Balance = (Cross Margin Unrealized PnL + Isolated Margin Unrealized PnL) + Futures Wallet Balance\",\"L0020024\":\"Copy Trading Account\",\"L0020025\":\"Copy trading margin balance = (cross margin unrealized PnL + isolated margin unrealized PnL) of the copy trading account + wallet balance of the copy trading account\",\"L0004932\":\"Grid\",\"L0021483\":\"Futures Grid Account Value = Unrealized PnL (Grid) + Grid Wallet Balance\",\"L0004006\":\"Earn account\",\"L0021679\":\"Earn valuation = total fixed investment + estimated fixed income + today’s Spot Earn income + Dual Investment positions\",\"L0021507\":\"2. The fixed Earn lock-in statistics are calculated at 00:00 (UTC+8) on the following day\",\"L0021508\":\"3. On the maturity date of the fixed Earn product, the system will stop calculating yield and both the principal and yield will be credited to your account on the same day\",\"L0015276\":\"Fiat\",\"L0013868\":\"Fund Account Assets = Total of All Fiat Assets x Exchange Rate\",\"L0013870\":\"Asset Type Explanation\",\"L0002499\":\"Got it\",\"L0014249\":\"Range\",\"L0002322\":\"Order Price\",\"L0014252\":\"Amount\",\"L6660446\":\"Precious Metals\",\"L6660447\":\"Major Cryptocurrencies\",\"L6660445\":\"U.S. Stocks\",\"L0002619\":\"1h\",\"L0002620\":\"4h\",\"L0002621\":\"8h\",\"L0002622\":\"12h\",\"L6002028\":\"Daily\",\"L6002029\":\"Weekly\",\"L0016410\":\"Monthly\",\"L0001895\":\"operation failed\",\"L6668648\":\"By number of users (high to low)\",\"L6668649\":\"By backtested APR from high to low\",\"L6668650\":\"By Latest Listing\",\"L6668694\":\"Recommended\",\"L0002701\":\"Manual\",\"L0014783\":\"Loading Failed\",\"L0003387\":\"Retry\",\"L0001440\":\"No data\",\"L0013449\":\"Use\",\"L6671134\":\"Based on historical data from the past year, this metric simulates the annualized return of a recurring investment strategy using this portfolio. Backtest results are for reference only and do not guarantee future returns.\",\"L6671133\":\"1Y Backtested Return\",\"L0010300\":\"Operation failed, please try again.\",\"L0001179\":\"Sharing failed\",\"L6668657\":\"My Auto-invest\",\"L0007395\":\"Running\",\"L0000479\":\"History\",\"L6668690\":\"Stop Auto-Invest\",\"L6668692\":\"Failed to stop\",\"L0000060\":\"Confirm\",\"L0000195\":\"Cancel\",\"L6668691\":\"Confirm stopping strategy {0}?\",\"L0011570\":\"General Information\",\"L6667135\":\"Parameter\",\"L0003942\":\"Transaction History\",\"L0001539\":\"Details\",\"L6668661\":\"Runtime {0}\",\"L6668655\":\"({0} stopped)\",\"L6668670\":\"Change Amount\",\"L0020986\":\"Stop\",\"L0021030\":\"Open another grid\",\"L0000042\":\"Share\",\"L0004914\":\"Total Profits\",\"L6668682\":\"Total Investment\",\"L6668677\":\"Currency | Target Ratio\",\"L6668676\":\"Auto-Invest Frequency | Times Triggered\",\"L6668679\":\"Investment per Period\",\"L6668673\":\"Avg. Auto-Invest Price\",\"L0021045\":\"Stop time\",\"L6668669\":\"Next Purchase Time\",\"L6668684\":\"Plan Details\",\"L6668683\":\"Plan ID\",\"L0000329\":\"Creation Time\",\"L6004781\":\"Crypto configuration\",\"L0012408\":\"Captcha verification failed to trigger\",\"L0008020\":\"Request timed out, please try again\",\"L0012486\":\"Captcha verification failed to initiate, please try again\",\"L0009340\":\"reCAPTCHA failed. Please refresh the page or contact customer service.\",\"L0001226\":\"Open futures trading\",\"L0007318\":\"Contracts trading is a high-risk trading practice. It is traded throughout the day without any up or down limits. Prices are prone to large swings due to the influence of market makers, speculators and government policies of various countries. LBank does not support users from Iran, North Korea, Syria, Cuba, Crimea, the United States, China and their territories to trade with contracts.\",\"L0007319\":\"I have read and agree to\",\"L0007320\":\"LBK Contracts Service Agreement\",\"L0000080\":\"More\",\"L0007328\":\"Please agree to the \\\"LBK Futures Service Agreement\\\"\",\"L0007334\":\"Open contract trading success\",\"L0007335\":\"Open contract trading failed\",\"L0021052\":\"Grid trading is a high-risk trading strategy. It operates 24/7 without price limits. Due to market makers, speculators, and policy influences, prices can fluctuate sharply. LBank does not support grid trading for users from Iran, North Korea, Syria, Cuba, Crimea, the United States, China, and their territories.\",\"L0021053\":\"LBank Grid Service Agreement\",\"L0021050\":\"Enable grid trading\",\"L0021051\":\"Please agree to the LBank Grid Service Agreement first\",\"L0021054\":\"Failed to enable grid trading\",\"L0000147\":\"Asset Overview\",\"L0002030\":\"Margin\",\"L0013324\":\"Order Center\",\"L0000902\":\"Funding History\",\"L0015235\":\"Asset Analysis\",\"L0000903\":\"Search\",\"L0004010\":\"Download APP\",\"L0000049\":\"Log in\",\"L0001924\":\"Sign up\",\"L0000155\":\"Deposit\",\"L0014902\":\"Connect\",\"L0001212\":\"Transfer\",\"L0000107\":\"About Us\",\"L0006772\":\"About\",\"L0006774\":\"Terms of Use\",\"L0006775\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"L0006776\":\"Cookie Policy\",\"L0017594\":\"Community\",\"L0019333\":\"LBank Media Kit\",\"L6660047\":\"LBank News Center\",\"L0022908\":\"Sitemap \",\"L0006777\":\"Products\",\"L0004658\":\"Buy Crypto\",\"L0005157\":\"Spot\",\"L0004759\":\"Futures\",\"L0006016\":\"Earn\",\"L0009331\":\"Copy Trading\",\"L6665609\":\"LBank Stocks\",\"L0013579\":\"Academy\",\"L0014621\":\"ICO Calendar\",\"L0016009\":\"Crypto Research\",\"L0020361\":\"Creator\",\"L0021104\":\"Submission system\",\"L0021105\":\"Submission collection\",\"L0023617\":\"Author collections\",\"L0021892\":\"BTC Retirement Calculator\",\"L0022603\":\"Crypto Profit Calculator\",\"L6665230\":\"Crypto Wiki\",\"L0019994\":\"LBank Pay\",\"L0004331\":\"Service\",\"L0000078\":\"Referral\",\"L0006778\":\"Affiliate\",\"L0003287\":\"Token Listing\",\"L0006697\":\"LBank Labs\",\"L0021091\":\"VIP Services\",\"L0006779\":\"Support\",\"L0004009\":\"Download\",\"L0004318\":\"Announcements\",\"L0000079\":\"Support Center\",\"L0006780\":\"Official Verification\",\"L0006781\":\"API\",\"L0006015\":\"Fee Schedule\",\"L0016141\":\"Law Enforcement\",\"L0021709\":\"Crypto Widget\",\"L0012724\":\"Crypto Calculator\",\"L0014095\":\"Crypto Q\u0026A\",\"L0001819\":\"Buy {0}\",\"L0020481\":\"Sell\",\"L0020480\":\"Sell Crypto List\",\"L0001820\":\"Sell {0}\",\"L0003597\":\"Contact us\",\"L0006782\":\"Business\",\"L0022725\":\"Legal\",\"L0008029\":\"News\",\"L0016787\":\"Terms of Service\",\"L0008331\":\"Trading Rules\",\"L0000005\":\"Trade\",\"L6661987\":\"Public Disclosure\",\"L0000793\":\"Reset\",\"L0013308\":\"Jan\",\"L0013291\":\"Feb\",\"L0013292\":\"Mar\",\"L0013293\":\"Apr\",\"L0013294\":\"May\",\"L0013295\":\"Jun\",\"L0013296\":\"Jul\",\"L0013297\":\"Aug\",\"L0013298\":\"Sep\",\"L0013299\":\"Oct\",\"L0013300\":\"Nov\",\"L0013301\":\"Dec\",\"L0016850\":\"Select time range\",\"L0002292\":\"StartTime\",\"L0000680\":\"End Time\",\"L0013690\":\"Selected: {0} to {1}\",\"L0004110\":\"Last 7 days\",\"L0016081\":\"Last 30 days\",\"L0016082\":\"Last 90 days\",\"L0016083\":\"Last 6 months\",\"L0016084\":\"Last 1 year\",\"L0001610\":\"Got it\",\"L0000011\":\"Loading…\",\"L0007846\":\"Loading failed, click to load\",\"L0000290\":\"No More\",\"L0013147\":\"Load more\",\"L0021845\":\"Loading failed, please try again\",\"L0013738\":\"My Support Tickets\",\"L0008076\":\"Expand\",\"L0008075\":\"Collapse\",\"L0000982\":\"Account \",\"L0006012\":\"Deposit/Withdraw\",\"L0003451\":\"Activities\",\"L0001091\":\"Futures\",\"L0003735\":\"FAQ\",\"L0003440\":\"More\",\"L0003312\":\"Online customer service\",\"L0006798\":\"Live Chat\",\"L0018898\":\"Customer Support Team\",\"L0015126\":\"Just Now\",\"L0018897\":\"Dear LBank User\",\"L0018894\":\"Our online customer service system is currently experiencing connection issues. We are working actively to resolve the problem, but at this time we cannot provide an exact recovery timeline. We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.\",\"L0018895\":\"If you need assistance, please contact us via email and we will reply as soon as possible.\",\"L0018896\":\"Thank you for your understanding and patience.\",\"L0018892\":\"LBank Customer Support Team\",\"L0002382\":\"Select token\",\"L0004429\":\"All cryptos\",\"L0001106\":\"Add margin\",\"L0001172\":\"Reduce margin\",\"L0007321\":\"Maximum increase\",\"L0007322\":\"Maximum Decrease\",\"L0007324\":\"Current Position Margin\",\"L0007325\":\"Adjusted liquidation price\",\"L0007169\":\"Long\",\"L0007170\":\"Short\",\"L0001081\":\"Isolated\",\"L0001080\":\"Cross\",\"L0001973\":\"Amount\",\"L0008307\":\"Please enter correct quantity.\",\"L0013424\":\"Quantity must be greater than {0}\",\"L0007336\":\"Increase margin successfully\",\"L0007338\":\"Decrease margin success\",\"L0007337\":\"Increase margin failed\",\"L0007339\":\"Decrease margin failed\",\"L0000168\":\"Add\",\"L0000258\":\"Limit\",\"L0000552\":\"Market\",\"L0007213\":\"TP/SL set successfully\",\"L0007333\":\"Failed to set TP\u0026SL\",\"L0007211\":\"Canceled\",\"L0007212\":\"Failed to cancel order\",\"L0007164\":\"TP Trigger Price\",\"L0009771\":\"TP Order Price\",\"L0007166\":\"SL Trigger Price\",\"L0002524\":\"Entry Price\",\"L0009769\":\"SL Order Price\",\"L0000283\":\"Amount\",\"L0002044\":\"Action\",\"L0008270\":\"Position\",\"L0004766\":\"Orders\",\"L0006047\":\"Tip\",\"L0007209\":\"Cancel all orders successfully\",\"L0007210\":\"Failed to cancel all orders\",\"L0020211\":\"Cancel all “fixed-quantity” take-profit and stop-loss orders?\",\"L0011594\":\"Continue Adding\",\"L0002596\":\"TP/SL\",\"L0001073\":\"Open Short\",\"L0001072\":\"Open Long\",\"L0000968\":\"Cancel All\",\"L0008488\":\"Estimated PnL\",\"L0008779\":\"Contract Info.\",\"L0010122\":\"Please ensure that the Smart Contract information for the currency you deposited matches the information displayed below; otherwise, it may result in asset loss.\",\"L0000720\":\"Tips\",\"L0014707\":\"The smart contract for the deposit token has changed. Please check.\",\"L0010472\":\"Okay\",\"L0000198\":\"Copied\",\"L0000197\":\"Copy failed\",\"L0010620\":\"Est. total value\",\"L0019130\":\"Locked value\",\"L0010030\":\"Total balance\",\"L6664640\":\"Total Asset Valuation = Wallet Balance + Unrealized PNL. Cross Margin positions will be liquidated when the available cross margin is insufficient to maintain them; liquidation of Isolated Margin positions is calculated independently and is affected only by the margin allocated to that position.\",\"L6661556\":\"The locked value displayed here includes fixed-term Earn and dual investment. Products such as spot Earn and futures Earn, which do not involve fund transfers, are not included in the locked value of the Earn account.\",\"L0017496\":\"Total balance = available balance + occupied amount + unrealized PnL. Each of your positions has isolated margin and risk.\",\"L0009052\":\"Based on the policy requirements of your country/region, it is required to complete KYC verification before making a deposit.\",\"L0013873\":\"Deposit\",\"L0013874\":\"Withdraw\",\"L0000900\":\"Transfer\",\"L0021108\":\"Enable Auto-Earn\",\"L0021120\":\"Auto-Earn\",\"L0002657\":\"Turned on\",\"L0020244\":\"Omni account activated successfully\",\"L0020242\":\"Enable Omni Futures trading\",\"L0020243\":\"Omni Futures trading is a high-risk trading activity. It runs 24/7 with no price limits. All assets and prices come from on-chain data and may fluctuate drastically, which could lead to a total loss of your principal.\",\"L0017530\":\"\\\"Omni Futures Service Agreement\\\"\",\"L0019571\":\"I have crypto assets\",\"L0019572\":\"Deposit cryptocurrency\",\"L0019573\":\"Send crypto assets to your LBank account\",\"L0000920\":\"Transfer\",\"L0010645\":\"Transfer between different asset accounts\",\"L0019574\":\"I don’t have crypto assets\",\"L0001438\":\"Express\",\"L0019575\":\"Support deposits via bank card, PIX, and other payment methods\",\"L0012379\":\"P2P\",\"L0019576\":\"0 trading fees with over 300 payment methods supported\",\"L0000051\":\"Email\",\"L0005046\":\"Phone\",\"L0002060\":\"QR Code\",\"L0007801\":\"Wrong mobile number\",\"L0007802\":\"Invalid email address\",\"L0007803\":\"Wrong password\",\"L0010442\":\"New passwords entered do not match, please re-enter\",\"L0007805\":\"Wrong invitation code\",\"L0000560\":\"Password cannot be empty\",\"L0008622\":\"Login failed\",\"L0000132\":\"Login Password\",\"L0003471\":\"Forgot Password?\",\"L0000121\":\"Enter phone number\",\"L0000048\":\"Please enter login password\",\"L0007086\":\"Verify\",\"L0014156\":\"Your current IP is from a restricted country or region. Due to local laws and regulations, we are unable to provide service. Sorry for the inconvenience.\",\"L0009572\":\"Your phone number is from a restricted region, preventing us from serving you in compliance with local laws. We apologize for any inconvenience.\",\"L0009570\":\"Restricted service\",\"L0000564\":\"Confirm\",\"L0017079\":\"The account already exists\",\"L0017080\":\"Would you like to go to the login page?\",\"L0000065\":\"Email verification code\",\"L0007829\":\"Code sent to {0}\",\"L0007827\":\"SMS code\",\"L0005971\":\"Google Auth Code\",\"L0007896\":\"Please go to Google Authenticator to copy the code\",\"L0000652\":\"Security Verification\",\"L0012454\":\"Please enter the 6-digit verification code\",\"L0012452\":\"Verification code generated\",\"L0012451\":\"SMS\",\"L0012455\":\"{0}{1} verification code\",\"L0001395\":\"Paste\",\"L0000118\":\"Email Verification\",\"L0000120\":\"Phone Verification\",\"L0000122\":\"Google Auth\",\"L0000054\":\"Verification Code\",\"L0000517\":\"Please enter verification code\",\"L0007842\":\"Sending\",\"L0003649\":\"Send\",\"L0011062\":\"Verification code not received\",\"L0011063\":\"If not received, please try the following:\",\"L0011064\":\"1. Confirm the email address entered is correct.\",\"L0011065\":\"2. Check your spam folder. If the verification email is in this folder, move it to your inbox to improve the success rate of receiving these emails next time.\",\"L0011075\":\"3. Please be patient, there may be delays in email delivery.\",\"L0011076\":\"If you still haven't received the verification code, please contact our customer service team.\",\"L0011082\":\"Didn't receive the verification email?\",\"L0018960\":\"Didn’t receive the SMS verification code?\",\"L0000809\":\"Customer Service\",\"L0018925\":\"Resend {0}\",\"L0018850\":\"Resend verification code\",\"L0018926\":\"If you have not received the verification code for a long time, please check the following:\",\"L0018927\":\"Make sure your mobile number is {0}\",\"L0018928\":\"Check if your mobile number has an outstanding balance\",\"L0018929\":\"Check if the verification code is in your SMS spam folder\",\"L0018930\":\"The verification code may be delayed, please try again after {0} minutes\",\"L0007819\":\"Verified by Google Authenticator\",\"L0014361\":\"Switch to Google verification\",\"L0007820\":\"Recommended verification method\",\"L0014360\":\"Switch to phone verification\",\"L0007821\":\"Receive verification code via {0}\",\"L0007824\":\"Standard rates may apply\",\"L0011231\":\"Switch to email verification\",\"L0007822\":\"Receive secure links via {0}\",\"L0007823\":\"Receive voice verification via {0}\",\"L0000052\":\"Enter email\",\"L0014144\":\"Click the icon in the top right corner to scan the QR code on the {0} homepage.\",\"L0014143\":\"Please confirm login on your device\",\"L0005025\":\"Refresh QR Code\",\"L0018381\":\"Please open the webpage using Chrome or Firefox to install {0}\",\"L0007845\":\"Initialization failed, click to retry\",\"L6671993\":\"Google login failed, please try again.\",\"L0017897\":\"This account is already linked to another {0} account, please choose a different account\",\"L0017898\":\"This third-party account is already linked to another LBank account.\",\"L0005505\":\"Registration failed\",\"L6672267\":\"Plea