L6668933\":\"Please select a reason for reporting\",\"L0000267\":\"Submit\",\"L6668934\":\"Reason for Report\",\"L6669484\":\"Your report has been received. The platform will review it as soon as possible.\",\"L0018406\":\"Avail\",\"L6663034\":\"Estimated profit is the expected return calculated based on the assumption that your trading direction is correct and using the current price. Actual profit is subject to the final settlement result. Please note: In high-leverage trading, even if the final result aligns with your prediction, your position may still be forcibly liquidated if the price reaches the liquidation price during the holding period, which may result in the loss of your principal. Please pay close attention to position risks.\",\"L6663033\":\"Est. Profit\",\"L0007199\":\"Order price cannot be empty\",\"L0005757\":\"Order amount cannot be empty\",\"L0007749\":\"The minimum order quantity is {0}\",\"L0005441\":\"Failed to place order\",\"L0001058\":\"Margin\",\"L0009073\":\"Open Long\",\"L0009074\":\"Open Short\",\"L0006986\":\"Yes\",\"L0006987\":\"No\",\"L0000038\":\"Price\",\"L0000966\":\"Buy\",\"L0000969\":\"Sell\",\"L0012552\":\"Cost value\",\"L6663061\":\"5 Minutes\",\"L6663062\":\"15 Minutes\",\"L6663063\":\"1 Hour\",\"L6663064\":\"4 Hours\",\"L6663348\":\"Time Unit\",\"L0002840\":\"Market\",\"L6664836\":\"Position Details\",\"L6664834\":\"Current Position Count:\",\"L6664835\":\"Unrealized PnL:\",\"L6664837\":\"View Position Details\",\"L0010291\":\"Futures price must not exceed {0}.\",\"L0005440\":\"Order successfully placed\",\"L6663020\":\"The prediction market only supports Hedge Mode. Please switch your position mode before placing an order.\",\"L0001066\":\"Order Confirmation\",\"L6663346\":\"Prediction Futures Trading Rules\",\"L6663347\":\"Fast Futures Trading Guide\",\"L0000795\":\"Got it\",\"L6664613\":\"Insufficient account balance. Please deposit or transfer funds before placing an order.\",\"L0000769\":\"Deposit\",\"L0014216\":\"Transfer\",\"L0000406\":\"Insufficient balance\",\"L6663992\":\"Your buy price is higher than the market price. The system will attempt to execute your order at the current best price. If the market price changes while placing the order, the order will be placed at your original limit price. Confirm order?\",\"L6663993\":\"Your sell price is lower than the market price. The system will attempt to execute your order at the current best price. If the market price changes while placing the order, the order will be placed at your original limit price. Confirm order?\",\"L6664630\":\"View Order Details, Order ID: {0}\",\"L0017641\":\"Add Funds\",\"L6665050\":\"Add funds to your account by depositing or transferring assets\",\"L6665525\":\"In low-liquidity market conditions, orders may experience additional slippage.\",\"L6665056\":\"Place Order\",\"L6660873\":\"Are you satisfied with your recent trading experience?\",\"L6660874\":\"Very Dissatisfied\",\"L6660875\":\"Very Satisfied\",\"L6660884\":\"Dissatisfied\",\"L0003584\":\"Normal\",\"L6660885\":\"Satisfied\",\"L6661284\":\"Which areas do you think we need to improve?\",\"L6661285\":\"Which areas do you think we have done well?\",\"L0017668\":\"Network error, please check network settings\",\"L6660877\":\"Operation Lag\",\"L6660878\":\"Missing Features\",\"L6660879\":\"Interface Is Complicated\",\"L6660880\":\"Slow Execution Speed\",\"L6660890\":\"Interface Design\",\"L6660886\":\"Variety of Cryptos\",\"L6660887\":\"Easy to Use\",\"L6660888\":\"Many Features\",\"L6660889\":\"Many Events\",\"L6660881\":\"More Feedback\",\"L6661283\":\"Please enter your suggestions to help us improve. If you need assistance, please contact online customer support.\",\"L6660883\":\"I am willing to participate in follow-up paid surveys.\",\"L0006543\":\"Successful\",\"L0023750\":\"Your feedback has been received, thank you for your support.\",\"L0014727\":\"By using the LBank website and/or maintaining your account, you agree to our updated {0}, {1}, and {2}. Clicking \\\"Yes, I accept\\\" confirms you have read and agreed to these terms and policies.\",\"L0014741\":\"Yes, I Accept\",\"L0021124\":\"Upgrade your LBank VIP level to subscribe\",\"L0021121\":\"Activate LBank VIP to subscribe\",\"L0021125\":\"We sincerely invite you to upgrade to LBank VIP and unlock a premium experience.\",\"L0021122\":\"We sincerely invite you to become an honored LBank VIP member!\",\"L0021152\":\"Upgrade to VIP\",\"L0021123\":\"Become VIP\",\"L0011903\":\"Interest rate increase\",\"L0001444\":\"Deposit\",\"L0021484\":\"Spot Earn\",\"L6664287\":\"Stop Earning\",\"L0010868\":\"Hold to Earn\",\"L6663953\":\"Confirm rate boost\",\"L0004647\":\"Current Assets\",\"L0024291\":\"The amount exceeding the maximum investment limit will not be included in Spot Earn\",\"L6660442\":\"Add Funds\",\"L0021112\":\"Estimated earnings/day\",\"L0011909\":\"Interest Boost Coupon\",\"L6664491\":\"The maximum amount eligible for the interest boost is {0} {1}. Any amount exceeding this limit will not receive the interest boost.\",\"L6662054\":\"Annualized Yield\",\"L6663489\":\"The system will take 24 snapshots of the spot account balance. The minimum snapshot value will be used as the basis for reward distribution, and this data is updated daily.\",\"L0001032\":\"Yesterday's Principal\",\"L0002048\":\"Cumulative Profit\",\"L0019308\":\"Est. APR\",\"L6662053\":\"Product Rules\",\"L0004639\":\"Min investment\",\"L0024290\":\"Maximum Investment Amount\",\"L0004640\":\"Interest-bearing model\",\"L0021820\":\"Base Interest Rate\",\"L6660617\":\"Within {0} days\",\"L0016407\":\"New User Exclusive\",\"L0021815\":\"New Users\",\"L0021478\":\"Exclusive\",\"L0003702\":\"Upcoming\",\"L0008339\":\"Started\",\"L0000699\":\"Ended\",\"L6660470\":\"None available\",\"L0008287\":\"{0} Cont\",\"L6663367\":\"Earn Boost Voucher\",\"L6664494\":\"No Interest Boost Vouchers available\",\"L6668007\":\"Interest Boost Voucher available for {0} {1} transfer-in\",\"L0003269\":\"Deposit\",\"L0023271\":\"Enable spot auto earn\",\"L0023276\":\"Disable spot auto earn\",\"L0023272\":\"After enabling, you will automatically participate in newly launched projects. Assets that meet the requirements will start earning.\",\"L0021148\":\"After disabling, your assets will stop generating yield. Keep it enabled to continue earning.\",\"L0021129\":\"Start Earning\",\"L0002135\":\"Close confirmed\",\"L0017883\":\"Maybe later\",\"L0023273\":\"No lock-up required\",\"L0023274\":\"Trade and use funds anytime daily\",\"L0023275\":\"Earnings are distributed daily\",\"L0001450\":\"I have read and agree to\",\"L0021637\":\"LBank Earn Service Agreement\",\"L6666408\":\"Complicated rules\",\"L6666409\":\"Complicated process\",\"L6666417\":\"Unclear returns\",\"L6666410\":\"High entry barrier\",\"L6666411\":\"Wide selection of coins\",\"L6666412\":\"Easy to use\",\"L6666413\":\"Attractive interface\",\"L6666414\":\"High interest rates\",\"L6666415\":\"Low interest rates\",\"L6666416\":\"Limited product selection\",\"L6666418\":\"High risk\",\"L6666419\":\"Fast settlement\",\"L6666420\":\"Goal achieved\",\"L6666421\":\"Convenient redemption\",\"L6666422\":\"Transparent information\",\"L0021126\":\"Enable Futures Earn\",\"L0021130\":\"Disable Futures Earn\",\"L0021127\":\"Earn yield while opening positions — improve capital efficiency and let your futures funds generate additional returns.\",\"L0021131\":\"After disabling, your assets will stop generating yield. Keep it enabled to continue earning.\",\"L0002774\":\"Locked\",\"L0001497\":\"Log In / Register\",\"L0019239\":\"Sold out\",\"L0003741\":\"Lockup\",\"L0001000\":\"Verify\",\"L0000249\":\"Order ID\",\"L0003724\":\"Locked amount\",\"L0001467\":\"Estimated Return\",\"L0003712\":\"Locked Time\",\"L0006305\":\"Estimated time to receive\",\"L6667442\":\"Interest boost {0}\",\"L0003766\":\"Insufficient available assets.Go {0}\",\"L0016360\":\"Minimum amount: {0}{1}\",\"L0016683\":\"No available quota for investment\",\"L0003693\":\"No more than the rest locks\",\"L6666057\":\"When the order matures, the principal will be automatically reinvested into a Locked Earn product with the same term. You can modify this in \\\"Earn Account \u003e Locked Earn\\\".\",\"L6662303\":\"Auto-Subscribe\",\"L0001482\":\"Max\",\"L0021576\":\"Subscribe Now\",\"L0008361\":\"Balance\",\"L0016314\":\"Your remaining quota\",\"L6669208\":\"The yield currency for this product is {0}. The yield is calculated based on the average price of {1}/{2}.\",\"L0000974\":\"Estimated Revenue\",\"L0019134\":\"Subscription time\",\"L0020267\":\"Now\",\"L6664988\":\"Interest Start Time\",\"L0001499\":\"Settlement Time\",\"L6662298\":\"Earnings will start accruing at 00:00 (UTC+0) on the day following your subscription. Interest will be redeemed together with the principal to your spot account upon maturity.\",\"L6662299\":\"Estimated earnings at maturity = Principal × Annualized yield / 365 × Product duration (days)\",\"L6662300\":\"The annual interest rate for subscribed locked-term products is not fixed and may change daily. The final settlement at maturity shall prevail. The annual interest rate does not represent the actual or expected return in fiat terms.\",\"L6662301\":\"After enabling auto-subscribe, once the locked product matures, the principal of the original order will be automatically subscribed to the same locked product. If not enabled, your principal will be automatically redeemed upon maturity.\",\"L6662302\":\"If no locked products are available for subscription during the auto-subscribe period, the principal of the original order will be automatically subscribed to the Spot Earn product of the same token. If the subscription to the Spot Earn product fails, the principal will be redeemed to the spot account.\",\"L0000717\":\"PnL\",\"L0001473\":\"Days\",\"L0001590\":\"h\",\"L6661691\":\"This product is sold out. Please select another product\",\"L6669949\":\"This product is exclusive to new users\",\"L6669797\":\"This product is not currently available for subscription.\",\"L6661898\":\"This product is exclusive to VIP{0}-{1}\",\"L6669948\":\"This product is exclusive to VIP users\",\"L6669582\":\"For the security of your funds, please complete identity verification before subscribing.\",\"L0014264\":\"Order in process\",\"L0003708\":\"Locked successfully\",\"L0001764\":\"Order Details\",\"L6669454\":\"Trade Again\",\"L0017055\":\"Have an account?\",\"L0000211\":\"Login\",\"L0017906\":\"This account is already registered, please link it!\",\"L0016328\":\"Go link\",\"L0017905\":\"This account is not registered yet, please register first!\",\"L0016326\":\"Register\",\"L0013876\":\"Spending Transactions\",\"L0016379\":\"Borrow\",\"L0016380\":\"Repay\",\"L0008819\":\"Fixed Amount\",\"L0010165\":\"All position\",\"L0000192\":\"Add Now\",\"L0002520\":\"Last Price\",\"L0001126\":\"Mark Price\",\"L0008289\":\"Est. Liq. Price\",\"L0010469\":\"Due to rapid market changes, please avoid setting SL trigger too close to estimated liquidation price to prevent triggering failures.\",\"L0011131\":\"When the trigger price and order price of a limit take-profit/stop-loss order are the same, or when market volatility is high, the order may not be executed after being triggered. Under extreme market conditions, market take-profit/stop-loss orders may also fail or be partially filled after being triggered.\",\"L0020209\":\"When the price reaches the trigger price, the position will be closed at market or limit price. If you’ve set multiple fixed-quantity TP/SL orders, only the trigger price closest to the latest price will be displayed.\",\"L0010194\":\"All position\",\"L0020210\":\"The quantity of TP/SL orders changes according to your position size. When the trigger price is reached, the position will be closed at market price.\",\"L0010196\":\"If the position quantity exceeds the maximum quantity limit for a market order or if there is insufficient margin when triggered, the order will fail.\",\"L0003972\":\"The amount shall not be nullable\",\"L0020421\":\"Add take profit/stop loss\",\"L0002544\":\"Positions\",\"L0007165\":\"Take Profit\",\"L0007167\":\"Stop Loss\",\"L0000737\":\"Trigger Price\",\"L0002319\":\"Order Price\",\"L0000039\":\"Increase\",\"L0006595\":\"Decrease\",\"L0013677\":\"By change\",\"L0010181\":\"Set trigger prices for Take Profit and Stop Loss based on the percentage change of the futures entry price.\",\"L0010178\":\"By PnL\",\"L0010182\":\"Set trigger prices for Take Profit and Stop Loss based on the expected PnL.\",\"L0010179\":\"By PnL%\",\"L0010250\":\"Set the trigger price for Take Profit and Stop Loss based on the expected PNL%.\",\"L0010180\":\"TP/SL price settings\",\"L0005987\":\"Last Price\",\"L0001524\":\"Mark Price\",\"L0010183\":\"TP/SL trigger price settings\",\"L0001229\":\"Mark\",\"L0001122\":\"Last\",\"L0019645\":\"When {0} reaches {1}, {2} order will be triggered, with an estimated profit of {3}\",\"L0020208\":\"Clearing take-profit and stop-loss prices will be treated as canceling all TP/SL orders\",\"L0010167\":\"Take Profit trigger price must be greater than {0}.\",\"L0010168\":\"Stop Loss trigger price must be less than {1}.\",\"L0010244\":\"Take profit trigger price must be less than {0}.\",\"L0010245\":\"Stop loss trigger price must be greater than {0}.\",\"L0010169\":\"Take Profit trigger price must be greater than the order entry price.\",\"L0010170\":\"Stop Loss trigger price must be less than the order entry price.\",\"L0010173\":\"Take Profit trigger price must be less than the order entry price.\",\"L0010174\":\"Stop Loss trigger price must be greater than the order entry price.\",\"L0013605\":\"TP trigger price cannot be empty\",\"L0010192\":\"{0} cannot be {1}.\",\"L0010248\":\"Take profit trigger price\",\"L0013606\":\"SL trigger price cannot be empty\",\"L0010249\":\"Stop loss trigger price\",\"L0010171\":\"Take Profit order price must be greater than {0}.\",\"L0010175\":\"Take Profit order price must be less than {0}.\",\"L0010247\":\"Take profit order price\",\"L0010172\":\"Stop Loss order price must be greater than {0}.\",\"L0010176\":\"Stop Loss order price must be less than {0}.\",\"L0010246\":\"Stop loss order price\",\"L0010163\":\"TP profit\",\"L0010164\":\"SL profit\",\"L0015640\":\"Your stop loss trigger price is lower than or equal to the estimated liquidation price, which may result in liquidation before the stop loss is triggered. Please consider adjusting the trigger price.\",\"L0001933\":\"Edit\",\"L0015641\":\"Your stop loss trigger price is higher than or equal to the estimated liquidation price, which may result in liquidation before the stop loss is triggered. Please consider adjusting the trigger price.\",\"L0011557\":\"H\",\"L0000460\":\"M\",\"L0011558\":\"S\",\"L0004038\":\"Buy now\",\"L6668689\":\"No transaction records\",\"L0001930\":\"Buy\",\"L0001196\":\"Filled\",\"L6668687\":\"Total Filled Amount ({0})\",\"L0000771\":\"Avg. Price\",\"L6668688\":\"Filled Amount ({0})\",\"L0000692\":\"Fee\",\"L6668675\":\"Auto-Invest Frequency \",\"L6668667\":\"Amount per Period\",\"L6668666\":\"riggered Auto-Invest Cycles\",\"L6668663\":\"Quote currency of the trading pair\",\"L0001801\":\"Crypto\",\"L6668668\":\"Total Quantity Purchased\",\"L6668665\":\"Auto-invest Profit ({0})\",\"L6668664\":\"Avg. Auto-Invest Price ({0})\",\"L6668685\":\"Plan created successfully\",\"L6668681\":\"Strategy Stopped\",\"L6668672\":\"History\",\"L6668659\":\"No Auto-Invest plans yet\",\"L6668628\":\"Create Auto-Invest\",\"L6660244\":\"You May Be Interested In\",\"L0003677\":\"Create\",\"L0005963\":\"Profile\",\"L0001085\":\"PnL%\",\"L0011818\":\"PnL\",\"L0001562\":\"Running Time\",\"L6000206\":\"Strategy Name\",\"L6668621\":\"Investment per order must be ≥ {0} {1}\",\"L6668624\":\"Please enter the investment amount per period\",\"L6668671\":\"Edit Amount\",\"L6668637\":\"Investment Amount per Order\",\"L6668797\":\"Note: Changes will take effect in the next Auto-Invest\",\"L0010555\":\"Available\",\"L6668785\":\"Auto-Invest Portfolio\",\"L6668622\":\"Keep at least one coin\",\"L6004417\":\"Add token\",\"L6668623\":\"Ensure the total investment ratio equals 100%\",\"L0000545\":\"Delete\",\"L6668619\":\"Investment ratio must be an integer between 1-100\",\"L6668629\":\"Remaining investment ratio\",\"L6003675\":\"Equal Distribution\",\"L6668634\":\"Select up to 10 coins\",\"L6668696\":\"You can select a maximum of\",\"L6668695\":\"{0} Coins\",\"L6668639\":\"Custom time\",\"L0004111\":\"Monday\",\"L0004112\":\"Tuesday\",\"L0004113\":\"Wednesday\",\"L0004114\":\"Thursday\",\"L0004115\":\"Friday\",\"L0004116\":\"Saturday\",\"L0004117\":\"Sunday\",\"L0019927\":\"{0} day\",\"L6668644\":\"First Investment Time\",\"L6668617\":\"{0} order amount \u003c {1} {2}, unable to place order\",\"L6668633\":\"Enable Auto-Earn. Assets from each auto-invest cycle will automatically participate in Spot Earn for compound interest.\",\"L6669013\":\"Auto-Invest Plan Name\",\"L6668643\":\"Please enter auto-invest plan name\",\"L6668641\":\"Please complete auto-invest parameters\",\"L6668627\":\"Creation failed. Please try again later\",\"L0000962\":\"Created successfully\",\"L6668646\":\"First Auto-Invest time\",\"L6668642\":\"Please ensure your available balance is sufficient during the Auto-Invest period\",\"L0021839\":\"Creation confirmation\",\"L0017984\":\"Confirm creation\",\"L6002359\":\"Enable\",\"L6669040\":\"When making an Auto-Invest purchase, the available assets in your Spot account will be used to buy the target cryptocurrency. Please make sure to keep sufficient funds in your account in advance. Insufficient balance will cause the Auto-Invest purchase to fail.\",\"L0018173\":\"Failed to fetch job information\",\"L0003239\":\"Join Us\",\"L0004500\":\"Join LBank to achieve a successful career\",\"L0004105\":\"Apply now\",\"L0004501\":\"Employees are our most valuable asset!\",\"L0004499\":\"LBank is a \\\"Young OG\\\" exchange with a long history. We offer generous and fair incentive mechanism, flat management atmosphere, and fast decision-making mechanism. If you are ambitious, eager to break through yourself, and passionate about your work, join us! We will provide you with a broader development platform to do challenging work. We look forward to seeing the best of you and your great accomplishment.\",\"L0004502\":\"Vacancy\",\"L0004520\":\"Urgent jobs\",\"L0004522\":\"Job responsibilities\",\"L0004523\":\"Job requirements\",\"L0018174\":\"Submit resume\",\"L0009529\":\"Apply\",\"L0017592\":\"Join the LBank Community\",\"L0017593\":\"Get the latest LBank event updates and online support\",\"L0017842\":\"Italian\",\"L0017843\":\"Albanian\",\"L0017844\":\"Czech\",\"L0017845\":\"English\",\"L0017846\":\"Turkish\",\"L0017847\":\"Russian\",\"L0017848\":\"Dutch\",\"L6666268\":\"Portuguese (Global)\",\"L0017850\":\"Bengali\",\"L0017851\":\"Vietnamese\",\"L6666269\":\"Spanish (Global)\",\"L0017853\":\"Traditional Chinese\",\"L0017854\":\"Hindi\",\"L0017855\":\"Portuguese (Brazil)\",\"L0002713\":\"Arabic\",\"L0017856\":\"Swedish\",\"L0017857\":\"Latvian\",\"L6666270\":\"French (Global)\",\"L0017859\":\"Overseas Chinese\",\"L0017860\":\"Thai\",\"L0017861\":\"Uzbek\",\"L0017862\":\"Polish\",\"L0017863\":\"Slovak\",\"L0017864\":\"Persian\",\"L0017865\":\"Urdu\",\"L0017866\":\"Romanian\",\"L0017867\":\"Japanese\",\"L0017868\":\"Korean (Korea)\",\"L0017869\":\"German\",\"L0017870\":\"Bulgarian\",\"L0017871\":\"Swahili\",\"L0017872\":\"Ukrainian\",\"L0017873\":\"Filipino\",\"L0017874\":\"Hebrew\",\"L0017875\":\"Slovenian\",\"L0017876\":\"Greek\",\"L0017877\":\"Indonesian\",\"L0023802\":\"If you cannot find LBank in the App Store, please check whether your Apple ID belongs to a region where LBank is available. For details, refer to {0}\",\"L0023803\":\"“LBank User Agreement”\",\"L0023800\":\"iOS LBank App Download Guide\",\"L0023801\":\"Register a New Apple ID\",\"L0023804\":\"1. Visit the official Apple website {0}.\",\"L0023805\":\"2. Scroll to the bottom of the page, {0} switch to “LBank Supported Regions” → {1} click Apple Account → {2} select Create Your Apple Account at the top.\",\"L0023806\":\"3. Use a new email address that has not been registered with an Apple ID, select an “LBank Supported Region”, and provide a valid mobile number that can receive verification codes to complete the registration process.\",\"L0023807\":\"4. Once you complete the verification steps as instructed, your Apple ID will be created.\",\"L0020976\":\"Failed to load. Please refresh to retrieve data.\",\"L0024375\":\"New User Rewards Zone\",\"L0023788\":\"Android Installation Guide\",\"L0024376\":\"iOS Installation Guide\",\"L0020477\":\"App Beginner's Guide\",\"L0004321\":\"Download APP\",\"L0024368\":\"Can’t find the app store? Check {0}\",\"L0020516\":\"iOS Guide\",\"L0020700\":\"Download the App Now\",\"L0020701\":\"Trade anytime, anywhere with a seamless all-in-one experience.\",\"L0001476\":\"Join Now\",\"L0024372\":\"For detailed steps, please refer to {0} and follow {1} to avoid selecting unsupported regions.\",\"L0023795\":\"How to register?\",\"L0024373\":\"LBank User Agreement\",\"L0023789\":\"1. Click “Download LBank” and follow the instructions to download and install.\",\"L0023790\":\"2. If you encounter any issues during the installation process, please {0} online customer support.\",\"L0023791\":\"Contact\",\"L0023792\":\"iOS Installation Guide\",\"L0024369\":\"If you cannot find LBank in the App Store, please create a new Apple ID by following the steps below and try again.\",\"L0013021\":\"Step 1\",\"L0024370\":\"Open your browser and visit the Apple Account management page. At the bottom of the page, set the country/region to a region supported by LBank.\",\"L0024371\":\"Click “Create Your Apple Account” → “Create a New Apple Account”\",\"L0024374\":\"Regions Supported by LBank\",\"L0013024\":\"Step 2\",\"L0023796\":\"Sign in to the App Store and download the LBank App.\",\"L0023797\":\"1. Open the {0} App Store → sign in with the newly registered Apple ID.\",\"L0023798\":\"2. After successful sign-in → {0} search for “LBank” → {1} tap “Get”.\",\"L0023799\":\"3. After tapping “Get” and completing the download and installation, sign in to LBank to proceed.\",\"L0024377\":\"Canada\",\"L0015674\":\"United States\",\"L0024378\":\"Albania\",\"L0024379\":\"Austria\",\"L0024380\":\"Poland\",\"L0024381\":\"Germany\",\"L0024382\":\"Finland\",\"L0024383\":\"Czech Republic\",\"L0024384\":\"Latvia\",\"L0024385\":\"Norway\",\"L0024386\":\"Switzerland\",\"L0024387\":\"Slovakia\",\"L0024388\":\"Hungary\",\"L0024389\":\"Ireland\",\"L0024390\":\"Belarus\",\"L0024391\":\"Belgium\",\"L0024392\":\"Netherlands\",\"L0024393\":\"Lithuania\",\"L0024394\":\"Malta\",\"L0024395\":\"Portugal\",\"L0024396\":\"Slovenia\",\"L0024397\":\"Spain\",\"L0024398\":\"Italy\",\"L0024400\":\"Bulgaria\",\"L0024399\":\"Estonia\",\"L0024401\":\"Iceland\",\"L0024402\":\"Denmark\",\"L0024403\":\"France\",\"L0024404\":\"Montenegro\",\"L0024405\":\"Croatia\",\"L0024406\":\"Luxembourg\",\"L0024407\":\"Moldova\",\"L0024408\":\"Sweden\",\"L0024409\":\"Cyprus\",\"L0024410\":\"Türkiye\",\"L0024411\":\"Greece\",\"L0024412\":\"Oman\",\"L0024413\":\"Angola\",\"L0024414\":\"Botswana\",\"L0024415\":\"Gambia\",\"L0024416\":\"Gabon\",\"L0024417\":\"Qatar\",\"L0024418\":\"Kenya\",\"L0024419\":\"Malawi\",\"L0024420\":\"Mauritania\",\"L0024421\":\"Namibia\",\"L0024422\":\"Nigeria\",\"L0024423\":\"Seychelles\",\"L0024424\":\"Uganda\",\"L0024425\":\"Jordan\",\"L0024426\":\"Azerbaijan\",\"L0024427\":\"Bahrain\",\"L0024428\":\"Burkina Faso\",\"L0024429\":\"Republic of the Congo\",\"L0024430\":\"Mali\",\"L0024431\":\"South Africa\",\"L0024432\":\"Sierra Leone\",\"L0024433\":\"Saudi Arabia\",\"L0024434\":\"Armenia\",\"L0024435\":\"Israel\",\"L0024436\":\"Zambia\",\"L0024437\":\"Benin\",\"L0024438\":\"Cape Verde\",\"L0024439\":\"Ghana\",\"L0024440\":\"Cameroon\",\"L0024441\":\"Kuwait\